{
  "slug": "cypress",
  "name": "Cypress",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Create, update, and fix Cypress tests. Connect to Cypress Cloud to see test results and use data to manage your test suite.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `cypress-author` (Creates, updates, and fixes Cypress tests (E2E/end-to-end and component tests)), `cypress-docs` (Search and extract Cypress information from official documentation (docs.cypress.io, cypress.io); prefer LLM markdown under /llm/* and refuse unverified…), `cypress-explain` (Explains Cypress tests (E2E and component tests), and answers questions about Cypress use and behavior)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `cypress-cloud`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cypress@claude-community` from `cypress-io/ai-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
